{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_037nao0443_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_037nao0443_1000_p", "source_sha256": "24438b79267a83830446f22c2a9f85c7c20ab0f67faf42de64b7ef4070842125", "ja": "（今日は奈緒が出演するPVの撮影だった。ロボット犬\n『アオノリ』との交流の様子は感動的だったな……！）", "zh": "（今天拍摄了奈绪出演的PV。她和机器狗“青海苔”互动的样子真令人感动啊……！）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_037nao0443_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_037nao0443_1001_037nao", "source_sha256": "eae3262035c0c52eb4ce820894c2c0c3a2322d48b3de5aba2dcbb3a0eac5f6a8", "ja": "あ、{$P$}さん！　向こうで\n散歩してるあの犬、ちょっとアオノリに似てません？", "zh": "啊，{$P$}先生！那边正在散步的那只狗，是不是有点像阿织？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_037nao0443_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_037nao0443_1002_p", "source_sha256": "494a092b608ba97ae6cdfb939a8b8d96a2fa3e192d49b92ac2fa888c62e91cb0", "ja": "そう……かな？\n言われてみれば、似てるかもしれないな。", "zh": "是……吗？\n这么一说，好像确实有点像。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_037nao0443_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_037nao0443_1003_037nao", "source_sha256": "b2ab8f676d7c720e8923767f24d46db27d079407dd73a82538c00e2349fbc264", "ja": "そうですって！　はあ……これがアオノリロス……。\nアオノリ、元気にしてるかなぁ……。", "zh": "都说是这样啦！唉……这就是アオノリ不在身边的失落感啊……  \n不知道アオノリ现在过得好不好……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_037nao0443_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_037nao0443_1004_p", "source_sha256": "ee250af6ccfa144fa64910ceb2332cc19896792f9527692ca228f6b3e65f9bb5", "ja": "いや、別れたばかりだろ……。まあ、奈緒とアオノリは\n仲が良かったからな。寂しくなる気持ちもわかるよ。", "zh": "不是，才刚分别吧……不过，奈绪和阿奥诺里关系很好嘛。会觉得寂寞也能理解。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_037nao0443_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_037nao0443_1005_037nao", "source_sha256": "c597e72af4dd40c93f73f774623749fb79db24a0f53536384fd70af9c635a496", "ja": "はい。アオノリと私は相棒ですから！\nまあ、仲良うなるまでが大変でしたけど……。", "zh": "是的！因为阿乌诺利和我是搭档嘛！\n不过，在变得要好之前，可是费了不少工夫……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_037nao0443_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_037nao0443_1006_037nao", "source_sha256": "9cf736278d056e1d039202bc7f798b631127267a5fcc0874b50b709d56006fe1", "ja": "関西弁は通じひんし、充電はすぐ切れるし……。\n芸も、なかなか覚えへんかったなぁ。", "zh": "听不懂关西方言，电量又很快就耗尽……才艺也怎么都学不会呢。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_037nao0443_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_037nao0443_1007_037nao", "source_sha256": "ae3ef7e7fa367ad4fa962eea8246ff42995740f71dd07c30e5d1167a6b291e3e", "ja": "でも、そうやって一緒にいるうちに、\nだんだんアオノリのことが可愛く見えてきて……。", "zh": "不过，在那样一起相处的过程中，我渐渐觉得青海苔也变得可爱起来了……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_037nao0443_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_037nao0443_1008_p", "source_sha256": "bcb06606428c21e1a57bdcf42fc53e5a83fd471446751a78f7b9f4d62382e663", "ja": "……『手がかかる子ほどかわいい』みたいな？", "zh": "……就像“越让人操心的孩子越惹人怜爱”那样？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_037nao0443_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_037nao0443_1009_037nao", "source_sha256": "a92b85d5bb5a92da87bd577e1b5cc8456d67d8fc5a55f2bb2e79657fab315791", "ja": "そうそう、それです！　私も必死でしたけど、\nきっと、アオノリも一生懸命やったと思うんです。", "zh": "对对，就是这个！我当时也拼尽全力了，\n阿蓝肯定也努力过了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_037nao0443_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_037nao0443_1010_037nao", "source_sha256": "c919c8a78f2fa61f5884b4b8bb583e03e920be3eb438b735bd4d95dcca136ef5", "ja": "最初はなんも分からんかったのに、\n最後は関西弁まで覚えてくれて……。", "zh": "一开始什么都不懂，\n到最后连关西腔都学会了……。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_037nao0443_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_037nao0443_1011_037nao", "source_sha256": "a9faff668733f24b9c59578cfa1b64becfdf5539e273f1f0e6e5378bdcc96e91", "ja": "アオノリは、世界一のロボット犬でした！\nほんま、ええ子やったなぁ。", "zh": "ア奥诺利曾是世界第一的机器狗！\n真是个好孩子啊……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_037nao0443_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_037nao0443_1012_p", "source_sha256": "c8bc4de9876a87c6a6b08f42b0ebab56f9e01f28b9c011d1e179b22a12ee20cc", "ja": "奈緒……。", "zh": "奈绪……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_037nao0443_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_037nao0443_1013_037nao", "source_sha256": "823ae190e732248c896f3c9972a2fee172940bd48d44eceab705258faac37fd1", "ja": "……アカンアカン！　いつまでも寂しがってたら、\nアオノリに笑われちゃいますね。", "zh": "……不行不行！要是总这么舍不得，\n会被青苔笑话的呢。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_037nao0443_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_037nao0443_1014_037nao", "source_sha256": "2bc2198f0cdf5d8dca9f56d2eb05da94ab202acc402fa0005529ab6bf90a5143", "ja": "いつかまた、アオノリとコンビが組めたら……\n成長した私を見てもらいます！　待っててなアオノリ！", "zh": "要是哪天能再跟青苔搭档……\n一定要让她看到我的成长！等我啊，青苔！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
